---
config:
  layout: dagre
  theme: mc
---
classDiagram
    %% Core System Classes (Based on actual code)
    class QuestionBankSystem {
        +uploadQuestionBank(file)
        +generateSurvey(requirements)
        +analyzeResults(surveyData)
    }
    
    %% Data Layer Classes
    class QuestionBank {
        -List~Question~ questions
        +addQuestion(question)
        +getQuestionsByCategory(category)
        +reclassifyQuestions()
    }
    
    class Question {
        -String questionId
        -String text
        -String type
        -String category
        -int difficulty
        -String language
        -List~String~ options
        -String dedupKey
    }
    
    class SurveyRequirement {
        -int questionCount
        -List~String~ categories
        -String language
        -String userInput
    }
    
    %% Processing Engine Classes (From actual code)
    class WebCrawler {
        +crawl_all()
        +parse_survey_pages()
        +extract_questions()
        +save_all()
    }
    
    class DataProcessor {
        +clean_question_text()
        +normalize_for_dedup()
        +calculate_difficulty()
        +load_and_process_data()
    }
    
    class CategoryClassifier {
        -Dict category_keywords
        +reclassify_general_by_keywords()
    }
    
    class SurveyGenerator {
        +generate_survey()
        +generate_questionnaire()
    }
    
    class DataVisualization {
        +plot_difficulty_distribution()
        +plot_category_distribution()
        +plot_question_type_distribution()
    }
    
    %% Core System Relationships
    QuestionBankSystem --> QuestionBank : manages
    QuestionBankSystem --> WebCrawler : uses
    QuestionBankSystem --> SurveyGenerator : uses
    
    %% Data Processing Pipeline
    WebCrawler --> QuestionBank : populates
    DataProcessor --> QuestionBank : processes
    CategoryClassifier --> Question : classifies
    
    %% Survey Generation Flow
    SurveyRequirement --> SurveyGenerator : input
    QuestionBank --> SurveyGenerator : selects from
    SurveyGenerator --> DataVisualization : visualizes
    
    %% Component Dependencies
    DataProcessor --> CategoryClassifier : uses
    SurveyGenerator --> DataProcessor : uses processing
